---
globs: *.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- prefer destructuring imports, e.g. `import { method } from 'package';`
- disabling eslint rules should be an absolutely last resort, consider other solutions before disabling a rule
- if a rule _MUST_ be disabled, add a comment about why that's the only option
- use object lookup map instead of switch case statement when possible
- you MUST check for lint errors after adding new code and fix those errors before saying the work is complete
